tle, with a central chimney used to heat water. Samovars have been used in Russia and other parts of Eastern Europe for centuries and are central to the tea-drinking culture in these regions. Traditional samovars are heated with coal or wood, but modern versions may use electricity or gas. They are often ornately decorated and can be found in various sizes, from small tabletop models to large ceremonial ones.", "faceCount": 2400, "createdAt": "2024-04-18T15:11:14.420427", "vertexCount": 1198, "isAgeRestricted": false, "archives": {"glb": {"textureCount": 3, "size": 3678704, "type": "glb", "textureMaxResolution": 1024, "faceCount": 2400, "vertexCount": 1915}, "gltf": {"textureCount": 3, "size": 3627336, "type": "gltf", "textureMaxResolution": 1024, "faceCount": 2400, "vertexCount": 1915}, "source": {"textureCount": null, "size": 3387411, "type": "source", "textureMaxResolution": null, "faceCount": null, "vertexCount": null}, "usdz": {"textureCount": null, "size": 1624940, "type": "usdz", "textureMaxResolution": null, "faceCount": null, "vertexCount": null}}, "license": {"uid": "322a749bcfa841b29dff1e8a1bb74b0b", "label": "CC Attribution"}}, {"uri": "https://api.sketchfab.com/v3/models/50e624f7244d4da9aecd31b171e4dec0", "uid": "50e624f7244d4da9aecd31b171e4dec0", "name": "Drink Vessel", "staffpickedAt": null, "viewCount": 76, "likeCount": 1, "animationCount": 0, "viewerUrl": "https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/none-50e624f7244d4da9aecd31b171e4dec0", "embedUrl": "https://sketchfab.com/models/50e624f7244d4da9aecd31b171e4dec0/embed", "commentCount": 0, "isDownloadable": true, "publishedAt": "2015-03-27T20:29:47", "tags": [{"name": "drink", "slug": "drink", "uri": "https://api.sketchfab.com/v3/tags/drink"}, {"name": "teapot", "slug": "teapot", "uri": "https://api.sketchfab.com/v3/tags/teapot"}, {"name": "urn", "slug": "urn", "uri": "https://api.sketchfab.com/v3/tags/urn"}, {"name": "kitchen", "slug": "kitchen", "uri": "https://api.sketchfab.com/v3/tags/kitchen"}, {"name": "no